From ef104617f180beb483554a2f733baf5b40ff87e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:12:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Compute the nodal blocks of the tangent operator applied
 without assembly

The kernels of the stiffness matrices compute, besides all the blocks of
the pairs of nodes and the diagonals, the blocks of the pairs of a node
with itself (nodal blocks), also for the rank one terms of the FBar
formulation and the regularization of Faltus et al. The behaviour
integrators and the multi-material integrator add them in the layout of
the element restriction, one column of the blocks after the other; the
tangent operator applied without assembly gives them on the true degrees
of freedom (NodalBlocksProvider), the constrained operator setting the
rows and the columns of the essential degrees of freedom to the ones of
the identity. The Jacobi preconditioner by nodal blocks uses them with an
operator applied without assembly, the blocks being gathered by a kernel.
